        <activityName xml:lang="en">Heat, at cogen 160kWe Jakobsberg, allocation heat</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heat, at cogen 160kWe Jakobsberg, allocation heat
The multioutput-process 'natural gas, burned in cogen 160kWe Jakobsberg, allocation heat' delivers the coproducts 'electricity, at cogen 160kWe Jakobsberg, allocation heat' and 'heat, at cogen 160kWe Jakobsberg, allocation heat'.;
UUID: 1b55beb7-ca94-36b2-9cc6-0028820dc47d
The module includes fuel input, infrastructure, emissions to air, and substances needed for operation.
Location: Efficiencies refer to a specific plant in Switzerland.
Technology: Specific cogeneration unit installed in Switzerland.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Emission measurements of operator, literature. Efficiencies from operator data. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_1b55beb7-ca94-36b2-9cc6-0028820dc47d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
